# Triple-quoted string as doc: value in function annotation
# Verifies that """...""" (desugared to unindent(...)) is accepted by the doc: handler.
# Uses return: Number (not Int) because + returns Number in the prelude type env.
[
  add: [fn@[doc: """
    Adds two numbers.
    Returns their sum.
    """ return: Number] [let x@Integer y@Integer] [+ x y]]
  result: [add 2 3]
]

---

%.result
=== out
Int(5)
